  "title": "Greek Pork Tenderloin",
  "description": "This Greek-style pork tenderloin features a zesty marinade of olive oil, garlic, fresh lime juice, and oregano which makes it super tender!",
  "authors": [
    "Dave Nash"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-09-01T23:44:03-04:00",
